    "detailed_description": "&quot;Is it possible that, having lost my job in middle age, I will never find love again?...&quot;<br><br>After losing my job in middle age, I was alone and feeling down at home one day when an old man paid me a strange visit and invited me to participate in an experiment?<br><br>&quot;This seems too suspicious, right?&quot;<br><br>But honestly, what do I have to lose now? So I dragged my heavy steps to the place the old man mentioned and slowly pushed open the door...<br><br>&quot;Welcome to the Love Quiz Battle!&quot;<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Game Features\u3011\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u25a3</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Diverse and Unique Beauties</strong><br>Gentle chefs, tsundere lab assistants, assertive teachers, and lively athletes\u2014various styles and personalities for you to experience different kinds of beauties.<br><br></li><li><strong>Using Both Heads?</strong><br>While increasing your knowledge, you can also satisfy your desires? What kind of new gameplay can such a strong collision create?<br><br></li><li><strong>Relive the Good Old Days</strong><br>Good times may pass, but they can come back! You can always revisit those delicious memories you gained after battles.<br><br></li><li><strong>Over 150 Choices!</strong><br>Only by breaking through numerous choices can you break through the beauties' defenses. Can you find the route to the end?<br><br></li><li><strong>Full Mouse Support for One-Handed Operation</strong><br>You need to use both heads! You know what I mean~</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Gameplay Instructions\u3011\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u25a3</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Game Objective:</strong> Choose a question set and answer the questions. You must not get more than two wrong out of ten questions to pass!<br><br></li><li><strong>Two-Choice Gameplay:</strong> Choose the correct answer between two options.<br><br></li><li><strong>Four-Choice Gameplay:</strong> Choose the correct answer among four options.<br><br></li><li><strong>Timed Four-Choice:</strong> Within the time limit, choose the correct answer among four options.</li></ul>",
